BKHrEx3F2HA","review_id":"2PMd4FUg0OiDm9cLJ_TzNg","date":"2020-01-06T19:44:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9249284863471985,"text_excerpt":"Wide variety of cigars. The owner, Armando, is so personable, knowledgeable and helpful. Great spot!!"},{"business_id":"RmDn5oeB_HABKHrEx3F2HA","review_id":"DKhgT-b03SuHI7mW_e0O7g","date":"2019-08-21T04:27:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9132190942764282,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite cigar shops. Soon as you walk in your greeted and it feels like your in the comfort of your own home. Sit back in one of the comfortable chairs while smoking a nice cigar and sipping on the finest whisky. This place has no bar but luckily for me I brought my own drink with me. If your a tourist you will be welcomed by some locals with a casual conversation, hey you might come across me in there."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
